{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why","id":948651,"title":"Your Favorite Arcana and why","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-11T09:44:32-07:00","id":948651,"title":"Your Favorite Arcana and why","content":"Not what you feel is the most powerful but the one you feel is the most fun or is closest to your heart.<br /> <br /> Mine is life because i love the idea of being able to heal and mess around with physical attributes\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T09:50:24-07:00","id":948655,"title":"","content":"Should be in the Mage forum?<br /> <br /> Mine is Time, cause time travel is too tempting and would ruin everything...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T10:22:38-07:00","id":948667,"title":"","content":"Mind. Fits me perfectly, always has. I'm extremely introverted, and my focus is on perception and manipulating people's perceptions. I can be extremely emotionally manipulative. Everything I do is very structured and just so. I'm just. If I had a single set of abilities, they would be telepathy and mind manipulation abilities. In terms of Arcana, everything about Mastigos fits me perfectly, as does everything about Mind.<br /> <br /> Fun fact, my nickname has been Jean after Jean Grey since I was eleven years old. True story. I don't think it's only because I'm a redhead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T11:07:37-07:00","id":948702,"title":"","content":"SPAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACE!<br /> <br /> Oh, it <i>would</i> be Mind, but Space is Mind-Lite <i>anyway,</i> so...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T12:10:36-07:00","id":948731,"title":"","content":"Time all the way. Time travel has always been my answer to the &quot;if you had one superpower&quot; question. It's also the most metaphysically fascinating Arcana to me.<br /> <br /> I'm gonna go ahead and move this thread to the Mage subforum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T12:35:34-07:00","id":948752,"title":"","content":"Life, because of the shapeshifting abilities. I wouldn't rest until Life 4!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T12:39:45-07:00","id":948757,"title":"","content":"I feel like Prime is super underloved, especially after the 2e changes. Nothing is more remarkable to me than the spells that grant Mage Sight or temporary Sleepwalker status to Sleepers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T12:44:58-07:00","id":948765,"title":"","content":"Fate. You can manipulate probability of almost anything. Make the probability of being affected by disease lowered, heighten your chances of winning the lottery, live a highly probable safe and fun life in your desired comfort for the rest of your life. <br /> <br /> That and manipulating oaths or making people actually live by their oaths (or anything they swear) could actually make some things better and make it impossible to get away from breaking it. Politics, I'm looking at you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the Drowning (Fansplat Ressurection) <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/779860-siren-the-surfacing-nwod-abandoned-fangame-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-resurrection</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","name":"SaulottheGentle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9750_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"453"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T13:26:18-07:00","id":948808,"title":"","content":"Hmm. Reminds me of a plot/mystery/setting I was thinking about (do we have a thread for those?): A city where everyone had 1 (and only 1) dot in an Arcanum. Just Veiling, Unveiling, and Compelling, but even just those...<br /> <br /> In regards to the OP, I think I'd go with Space or Time, personally. Time has &quot;do overs&quot;, but Space lets you really move around. Fate's a close second.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":".  Compelling is \u2022, not Ruling. Thanks, Mrmdubois. 08-11-2016, 05:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T13:40:18-07:00","id":948819,"title":"","content":"Compelling is the one dot Practice you mistook Ruling for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T13:43:37-07:00","id":948821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SaulottheGentle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=948765#post948765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fate. You can manipulate probability of almost anything. Make the probability of being affected by disease lowered, heighten your chances of winning the lottery, live a highly probable safe and fun life in your desired comfort for the rest of your life.</div> </div> </div> </div>You could even figure out the exact probability of creating an infinite improbability drive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T13:51:10-07:00","id":948828,"title":"","content":"Space has always been my favourite. I am always tempted to take it, even for characters that probably don't need it for their concepts to work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T13:52:25-07:00","id":948830,"title":"","content":"I'm actually a big fan of the subtle Arcana. The gross Arcana are more directly powerful but I just love how much more creative you can be with the subtle Arcana of each pairing.<br /> <br /> I find that with the gross Arcana you solve problems by casting a spell directly and rolling Gnosis + Arcanum. Whereas with the subtle Arcana you're more likely to open up some options with your spellcasting, but then you use mundane skills and attributes in order to make the most of those options. I find the latter way of doing things more fun most of the time.<br /> <br /> So here's my favourite subtle Arcana in order of preference.<br /> <br /> Mind, I love for the Astral Realms. I'm not a big fan of most of the mind spells, they're too ethically dubious for the real world me to want to use them. However exploring the Astral would be amazing and Mind is the best Arcanum to interact with the Astral.<br /> <br /> Fate, I love for just how dependent it is on mundane action. IMO there's no Arcanum that's more likely to lead to your mage actually going out, doing things and having fun adventures.<br /> <br /> Prime, I love for how subtle it is. There's almost no interaction with the fallen world through Prime, however it lets you deal a lot more with Supernal reality. You're more of a mage than any other mage if you master Prime. <br /> <br /> Death, I very secretly love for the forbidden secrets of working with the soul. While I wouldn't want to be a Reaper and steal other people's souls, I'd love to be a Moros and research them in order to find out secrets that no other mages has dared to learn (and reapers are too busy exploiting souls for selfish and practical purposes to ever really understand them). Shhh, don't tell the consillium. <br /> <br /> Spirit... I don't much care for. Sorry to break the pattern. It's a great Arcanum and I've got nothing against its design mechanically, but the part of me that would like playing a spirit mage would much rather play a Werewolf. I tend to think of Spirit much more in Werewolf terms than I do in Mage terms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T15:56:08-07:00","id":948909,"title":"","content":"And I'm here to always buck the trend. Always.<br /> <br /> For me, it's Forces. I love it dearly not because it has a huge chunk of magical powers most people think of when they think of wizards (hurling fireballs, lightning bolts, flying, telekinesis, etc.) but rather because all those powers are the least imaginative uses of Forces. Manipulate light, sound, and pressure to create near-perfect illusions (yeah, you can argue that Mind does it a lot better, and you're right, but that's the thing, Mind is better, so other mages would suspect you're using Mind rather than Forces until they take an Active look), manipulate radio waves to control communications, create motherfuckin' black holes, turn a space vessel into pure light and move across the galaxies while magnifying the speed of light itself (Space magic won't help you go places no one has gone before), just to name a few.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T16:33:17-07:00","id":948926,"title":"","content":"Life ^.^ Shape-shifting and mystical healing. Not just for yourself but others you care about too.<br /> <br /> Not only that I like the approach to mortality is has, Finite albeit extended lifespan but you don't really get old and frail I'm okay with the idea of dying one day I just don't want to become frail sickly and useless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4641-pebbles","name":"Pebbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T16:43:18-07:00","id":948929,"title":"","content":"Soul - More fundamental even than Prime. What's not to love?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T16:51:03-07:00","id":948931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>thenate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=948929#post948929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Soul - More fundamental even than Prime. What's not to love?</div> </div> </div> </div>Soul isn't an Arcana?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T17:01:59-07:00","id":948943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=948931#post948931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Soul isn't an Arcana?</div> </div> </div> </div>Unless he's a Tremere :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4641-pebbles","name":"Pebbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T17:02:38-07:00","id":948944,"title":"","content":"Fate- I'm some sort of control freak who really hate to leave things for luck or chance. This is why I never make a bet unless I'm sure how things would happen (and somehow, people keep making bets with me :P ). Plus, I'm signing contracts with my sister probably since I knew how to write, so using magically bound pacts and promises would just be natural for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T21:15:26-07:00","id":949089,"title":"","content":"I've always been a Prime guy. I love Prime . . . the raw truth of magic and the magic of truth . . . building items, and now hallows, laughing at enemy mages as their spells fizzle, other mages coming to me for mana . . . but the effects are nothing to me really. Just the name Prime says it all and has since the first edition. Magic, truth . . . yes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3741-servanous","name":"Servanous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T00:50:49-07:00","id":949174,"title":"","content":"Most fun would be Spirit. While I understand where Michael Kenner is coming from, the Spirit Arcanum isn't about silly things like harmony and treating spirits tit for tat. It's about an <i>entire world</i> that's yours to command and build from scratch. And sure, with Death, you could make ghosts and play with souls, but there are these weird ethical things going on there. Mind, Space, Life? Same. No such thing in spirit world. You carve out a piece of unreality, build your servants ex nihilo, and do whatever the hell you want. All you need is enough power to bend it to your will.<br /> <br /> Hubris? Never heard of it.<br /> <br /> I mean, imagine this: you can build your own Changeling!Arcadia in the Shadow. You know. For fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T02:00:57-07:00","id":949197,"title":"","content":"Space all the way! I love the idea of being able to teleport, create portals and alter vectors. The ability to create a room out of a hole in the wall is pretty darn sweet. And then there's that whole thing you can do to recreate the magic that hid Grimmauld place in the Harry Potter story. Want to know what you're friends are up to? Scry 'em! Want to go on vacation, but can't afford the hotel bill? Teleport where you want to go, then come back in the evening to sleep. Forgot to grab your keys? No worries, you can summon them! Or better yet, you can just blink right through walls! The place you're at is too hot or too cold, but you can't leave because you need to do something there? Open a portal to someplace of a drastically different temperature, then place a fan in the middle of the portal! Trying to find something? Space is there to help you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T03:52:30-07:00","id":949222,"title":"","content":"I'm a big fan of Prime. Its feel is like that of Magic at its most fundamental level. You can hide it, you can reveal it, call forth/store/destroy mana, you can ease people into seeing, or hold their eyes open and force them to see it until they go mad/blind from the revelation. Then, of course, if you need to, you can call down the raw fury of Supernal power and scour something out of existence with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T03:56:21-07:00","id":949224,"title":"","content":"Forces is my number one with Prime a close second.<br /> <br /> Forces is just so versatile, especially in the modern world: it can get you in almost anywhere (through illusions or hacking) lets you move about as you will (flight and speed enhancement), access data with ease, turn you invisible and inaudible, all sorts of fun stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T04:09:07-07:00","id":949226,"title":"","content":"Either space or life or spirit. Space because it has massive utility and you can do stuff like opening a portal which has one end in somebody's lungs and the other in a volcano. Life because it allows you to do stuff like shapeshifting and giving people crippling diseases and disorders just for mildly annoying you (totally haven't wished I could do that when driving). Spirit because it can mimic damn near every other arcana and you can pretend to be a pokemon trainer in a world where pokemon are psychotic, cannibalistic and want to take over your body then turn your face into a weird hybrid of person and squid. One of those. Or forces because you can manipulate energy really awesomely (like making the sound coming from a gunshot turn into electricity so someone shooting at you just winds up electrocuting themselves). Or matter because of the awesome matter manipulations (okay, I'm too tired here to think of something that doesn't involve murder by accidentally drinking glass).<br /> <br /> Thinking about it I have a lot of trouble picking which arcana I like most.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T04:54:13-07:00","id":949241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fumus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=949226#post949226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Either space or life or spirit. Space because it has massive utility and you can do stuff like opening a portal which has one end in somebody's lungs and the other in a volcano. Life because it allows you to do stuff like shapeshifting and giving people crippling diseases and disorders just for mildly annoying you (totally haven't wished I could do that when driving). Spirit because it can mimic damn near every other arcana and you can pretend to be a pokemon trainer in a world where pokemon are psychotic, cannibalistic and want to take over your body then turn your face into a weird hybrid of person and squid. One of those. Or forces because you can manipulate energy really awesomely (like making the sound coming from a gunshot turn into electricity so someone shooting at you just winds up electrocuting themselves). Or matter because of the awesome matter manipulations (okay, I'm too tired here to think of something that doesn't involve murder by accidentally drinking glass).<br /> <br /> Thinking about it I have a lot of trouble picking which arcana I like most.</div> </div> </div> </div>Falling Wisdom, eh?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T04:57:54-07:00","id":949242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=949241#post949241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Falling Wisdom, eh?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nooooo, I'm perfectly fine. I'm at understanding wisdom at the very least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T07:13:27-07:00","id":949293,"title":"","content":"Matter.<br /> <br /> I love the whole idea of exactly knowing how something is made and what materials it is made from, then reinforcing it do be even better at its intended purpose.<br /> Oh and just straight up creating the things I need from nowhere or removing stuff merely by willing it to not be.<br /> I will admit I am a big fan of the character Emiya Shirou from the Fate series and Matter lets me copy what he does to some extent.<br /> Also Golems.<br /> <br /> Last of all I like how Matter challenges me in achieving my goals instead of just giving me stuff, like I feel the other Arcana would do. Matter is good at giving you the right tools to achieve your goal, or improves the tools you already have, without just handing you the one solution shortcut. Then again I completely understand that particular power fantasy, but it is not what I am looking for in Mage at the moment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12164-zaephyrus","name":"Zaephyrus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T07:48:00-07:00","id":949309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fumus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=949242#post949242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nooooo, I'm perfectly fine. I'm at understanding wisdom at the very least.</div> </div> </div> </div>Opening a portal inside a volcano with one end attached to a person's lungs wouldn't work. Portals must be passed with intent, which volcanoes don't have (Usually). Not that it matters much with Co-Location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T10:41:52-07:00","id":949402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=949309#post949309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Opening a portal inside a volcano with one end attached to a person's lungs wouldn't work. Portals must be passed with intent, which volcanoes don't have (Usually). Not that it matters much with Co-Location.</div> </div> </div> </div>With co-location at least you couldn't, it would require the lava to occupy the same place as the lungs in the area (at least according to those who can see the overlap) and for you to touch the lava in order to move it across. Which 1: ow, and 2: requires a lot of luck and / or setup. Collapse or an unmaking spell however I can easily see as unraveling or unmaking the space that exists between the lung and a lung sized portion of the lava wherever it is, plopping a chunk of it into the chest cavity of the unsuspecting soon to be stiff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T10:53:45-07:00","id":949411,"title":"","content":"Life, without a doubt.<br /> <br /> Get rid of chronic pain. Depression. Look however the hell I want each day. Be at peak physical form. Make buttloads of money, if that's what you feel like, live long and happy... It has everything!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12017-ehkesoyo","name":"Ehkesoyo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12017_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T13:08:13-07:00","id":949480,"title":"","content":"You can add me to the Space camp. Also Time to further improve my abillity to stick my nose wherever I want to stick it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T18:52:13-07:00","id":949690,"title":"","content":"Matter. The idea of being able to resolve pretty much any mundane concern (dust into GOLD) is certainly a perk, but the primary draw for me is that no other arcana is as well suited to building and maintaining a home as Matter is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T19:02:43-07:00","id":949698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=949309#post949309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">intent, which volcanoes don't have (Usually).</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what Spirit is for! (Actually, is there a ruling on whether or not you can wake up a volcano to pour itself through a portal? I'm entertained that this is a question even worth asking.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T20:05:42-07:00","id":949750,"title":"","content":"There doesn't need to be, Spirit can rouse and awaken spirits of places as well as objects, so the answer is yes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T20:08:44-07:00","id":949754,"title":"","content":"Fate. I don't need handouts, just windows.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T20:47:47-07:00","id":949784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=949754#post949754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fate. I don't need handouts, just windows.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is one of the best lines for Mage I've ever seen. I'm going to have to remember that one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T22:59:16-07:00","id":949869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Errol216</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=949698#post949698\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's what Spirit is for! (Actually, is there a ruling on whether or not you can wake up a volcano to pour itself through a portal? I'm entertained that this is a question even worth asking.)</div> </div> </div> </div>The spirit isn't the volcano, the spirit reflects the volcano. It has no direct control over the actions of the material world item that it represents without using special manifestation conditions.<br /> <br /> However indirectly, it could use &quot;Influence: Volcano&quot; to induce the lava to flow through the portal in which case it would have been done with intent rather than just as a natural phenomenon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T23:06:42-07:00","id":949877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=949754#post949754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fate. I don't need handouts, just windows.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;With Forces I don't need Windows. I don't even need a <i>keyboard</i>.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T21:08:02-07:00","id":950425,"title":"","content":"Life and time, so that I can alter history into a sapient dinosaur civilization (meaning dinosaurs don't go extinct, but all of the old history's humans are now intelligent dinosaurs)... at least until the Time Squad legacy kicks my ass back into the original reality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T23:55:33-07:00","id":950460,"title":"","content":"Space: I just need...and here it is. \ud83d\ude01","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-14T08:52:55-07:00","id":950579,"title":"","content":"Fate. I choose who succeeds and who fails. Life becomes so very convenient in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11842-aeryes","name":"Aeryes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11842_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T13:51:08-07:00","id":955155,"title":"","content":"I'm going to third Matter. Aside from not having to worry about material concerns (making gold from air, etc), it's also just so incredibly versatile. Combat situations, transmute air into poison gas or change the pH of somebody's blood. Need a lair? Matter can carve one for you out of nothing. Plenty you can do by altering the conductivity or specific heat of a substance as well. Also making supermaterials with capabilities that far outshine carbon nanotubes is quite tempting. <br /> <br /> Just watch Fullmetal Alchemist if you need more inspiration for Matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2186-nerdynick","name":"Nerdynick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2186_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T16:49:24-07:00","id":955289,"title":"","content":"Space. Want to live forever? Set up your Howl's Moving Castle without the Time Arcanum (since there's no time you don't need sleep, food/water, etc.) Someone needs to die? Oh look, their body now co-locates with the ground they're standing on... and then suddenly doesn't any more: instant burial. Always wanted to fly? Change your own personal definition of &quot;down&quot; such that down is wherever your head is pointed. Need an alibi? &quot;But officer, this video clearly shows me on the other side of the world at the time the crime was committed!&quot; There is no better reality tv than Scrying. Out of ammo? Lol, that's something that happens to other people. Shall I continue?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1446-raikirah","name":"Raikirah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T18:07:55-07:00","id":955334,"title":"","content":"Took a long time to decide, but for me it'd be Death. Plenty of utility, but there's also deep layers of esoteric knowledge to pursue and investigate. Arcana that hold my interest are almost always more about what I can learn from them more than what I can do with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T13:29:55-07:00","id":956521,"title":"","content":"Favourite as in which one I just like most in general: Life, because never being ill, never dying unless you're just killet outright, possibly extending your lif ... Shapechanging is also nice, enhancing your body, and doing a poor man's &quot;mind control&quot; by affecting people's hormones physical reactions. <br /> <br /> Although, if it wasn't for the healing of diseases, I'd totally say Forces. Considering it can do anything with technology and software, and how important software is in today's society ... It'd just be extremely sweet. Getting stuff like weather control, invisibility and telekinesis is just icing on the cake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11756-razikale","name":"Razikale","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T13:17:07-07:00","id":957800,"title":"","content":"Fate, because it's the most versatile one and I like the concept of magically enforcing contrat. Would save me so much trouble in real life...<br /> <br /> But the closest to my heart would be Mind. Controlling and reading mind, boosting your own intelligence are things I find interesting but goetic magic is just so... appealling somehow...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12295-lokiel","name":"Lokiel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T00:23:05-07:00","id":959133,"title":"","content":"Definitely Forces. In this time and age all the knowledge of the world is one internet away, and Forces Knowing + Compelling spells would let me access that information from anywhere with just a smartphone. Matter for creating money? Why? I can just as easily make a convincing illusion of money or hack an ATM... or even better, go to the Casino and hit jackpot on those machines. Need to go somewhere? Unless I need to be there in 5 seconds, I can take the scenic route (flying is so much better than teleportation). Once at Mastery levels I can make my house pretty much self-sustainable. And don't forget that every living being is just a network of bio-electric impulses. While not as fine-tuned as Life or Mind, you can still telekinetically control a living being or wreck destruction by messing with nerve impulses. Finally, as matter is held together by forces, basic alchemy is still doable (and vaporizing a bullet before it's shot is also doable).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T03:47:00-07:00","id":959163,"title":"","content":"Life, life extension, create new organism, cure diseases, replace limbs, create biotechnology like living machines/computers, clone people, make a dragon, create an army of supersoldiers for yourself, and so much more. Its limitless, create microorganisms that can produce drugs/medicine/other compounds at will like tiny little factories.<br /> <br /> Power all your devices with biological batteries.<br /> <br /> Why throw a fireball when you can throw hyperadvanced flesh eating bacteria balls.<br /> <br /> Need money? Literally grow counter fit bills on a tree, instead of leaves then pick them off it. Or better yet imagine bacteria that consume carbon from the air, then process it into diamonds for you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T08:10:03-07:00","id":959253,"title":"","content":"I used to say Life. But Spirit can do almost anything any other Arcana can do (sans Prime) if you find the right Spirit. And at higher ratings, you can make or transform the right spirit if you can't find one. And it can do a lot of it without Paradox, since the spirits are doing things rather than you.<br /> <br /> Though I don't like Ephemera as a rule if I'm STing. Means a whole other set of NPCs to write up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T02:40:05-07:00","id":959721,"title":"","content":"Despite the immense personal satisfaction I'd get out of the Life Arcana, I'm sticking with Mind here (and an address list of everyone else on this thread, just to check on my newly Awakened <s>mind-slaves</s> friends)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T22:38:28-07:00","id":960246,"title":"","content":"Matter.<br /> Just so I can make a puns about how a given problem doesn't matter,<br /> and then immediately produce an item needed to overcome said problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11641-yelesom","name":"Yelesom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T05:12:52-07:00","id":960364,"title":"","content":"Life and spirit are a close tie. But i would go with spirit, a whole new universe to experience, so many new friends (psychos). I especially like those two in conjunction... and Neocologyst legacy whych allows to create lasting Life&lt;-&gt;Spirit alterations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T04:10:41-07:00","id":962189,"title":"","content":"A close tie between Mind and Fate for me. I've always been fascinated with manipulation of things bur from under the scenes. Also illusions and lies are so much fun to do, albeit sometimes it does just feel evil tricking other people and feeling superior about it just because you have epic Mind Powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9947-blackwoodcoven","name":"BlackwoodCoven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9947_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T23:30:21-07:00","id":965519,"title":"","content":"For me it's Life....Healing folks would be the greatest rush....Making myself into a male supermodel would be pretty cool as well","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12391-rtemplar","name":"rtemplar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T09:38:30-07:00","id":969277,"title":"","content":"Forces.<br /> <br /> <i>Everything</i> but the most esoteric of effects can be done with Forces and a little knowledge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T14:49:41-07:00","id":969469,"title":"","content":"Prime, the idea of experiencing, and eventually interacting with, then mastering greater meta-physicial Truth sounds amazing. It seems to resonate deeply with spirituality more fundamental that animism of actual spirits as CoD describes them. Also it is the Arcanum where Language is elevated to contain ideals, ideals take form, and allows me to manipulate and examine that which I can scourge from myself (Mana) to better understand who I really am.<br /> <br /> While most would say Mind is the best for introspection, I'd say Prime gets you a more objective point of view when used towards that end. (Time is better at self examining than Mind is because Mind shows all the biases as if they were real.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T14:56:28-07:00","id":969476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=948731#post948731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Time all the way. Time travel has always been my answer to the &quot;if you had one superpower&quot; question. It's also the most metaphysically fascinating Arcana to me.<br /> <br /> I'm gonna go ahead and move this thread to the Mage subforum.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Your &quot;one super power&quot; has the potential to fuck up everyone's lives via Butterfly Effect.<br /> <br /> Anyways, I'd have to say Life would be my favorite. The ability to shapeshift, becoming anyone or <i>anything</i> you desire. As well as the practical benefits of curing illnesses and improving physical fitness.<br /> <br /> And, of course, the ability to create artificial life. Which is the closest thing to godhood that any of the Arcana can boast about... Or would that be my hubris talking?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-14-2016, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T15:05:00-07:00","id":969481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/948651-your-favorite-arcana-and-why?p=969476#post969476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your &quot;one super power&quot; has the potential to fuck up everyone's lives via Butterfly Effect.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's just the responsibility that goes with being a mod.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,